WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:15.724
I am here
Just on another shore

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.477
Always in your corner
Watching you soar

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:24.358
Unbreakable bonds,
that's what we've got.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.443
Family takes care
of family, right?

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:29.279
See, you get it.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:31.323
Wait. I got a great idea.

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:34.368
You should come
live with me in Florida.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.119
Yeah, we're going
home tomorrow.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:37.704
Come on. Get in the bag.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.709
Wait, wait, Vivo,
where are you going?

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:45.087
Are you worried about where
you'll go to the bathroom?

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.673
It's OK.
I got wipes in here.

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:54.012
Oh, the weird kid.

00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:56.056
Gabi, what are you doing?

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:57.182
Just playing a tune.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.726
Look what I got.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.937
Are you excited
about today?

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.772
Oh, yeah, of course.

00:01:03.856 --> 00:01:04.773
What's today?

00:01:04.857 --> 00:01:07.943
It's your first cookie sale
with the Sand Dollar Troop.

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:08.944
Woot! Woot!

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:11.154
Yeah, I don't think
that's gonna happen.

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:14.700
I've taken the Sand Dollars
about as far as I can.

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:16.034
Gabi, what are you
talking about?

00:01:16.118 --> 00:01:17.786
You've only been
to one meeting.

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:21.123
I know,
but it's time to move on.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.457
Move on?

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.835
You just started
with the troop.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.461
You're still getting
to know them.

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:27.880
Tail never fails.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:32.050
Please, give them a chance.

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.136
Look, I made
my resignation video.

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:35.554
Cookies!

00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:39.141
Peace. We out. Bye!

00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:43.020
Creative.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.688
Wait, wait, wait.
This is the best part.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.774
I turned them
into zombie clowns.

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:50.569
Buy my cookies.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:53.197
You can't keep
pushing everyone away.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.992
If you don't at least try to
get along with other kids,

00:01:57.075 --> 00:01:59.119
you're going
to be very lonely.

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:01.371
Meh.

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:04.374
Gabriela, escúchame,
you're doing this.

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.835
I let you keep that--
that-- that purple hair.

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:07.836
You owe me one!

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.590
But Mum, all they ever talk
about are selling cookies,

00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:14.384
getting badges,
saving the Everglades.

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:16.678
It's so boring.

00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:18.847
You're going
to the cookie sale,

00:02:18.931 --> 00:02:20.557
you're going
to take selfies,

00:02:20.641 --> 00:02:23.227
and you're going
to have fun and bond!

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.895
Now put on the uniform!

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.188
It's really cute.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.701
Vivo! You're here!

00:02:39.785 --> 00:02:40.744
Yup. And now I'm leaving.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:44.873
You followed me, didn't you?

00:02:44.957 --> 00:02:46.583
And you snuck in my bag

00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:49.044
because you love me!

00:02:50.128 --> 00:02:51.839
I'm so glad
you're here, Vivo.

00:02:52.464 --> 00:02:54.883
Now I have someone to share
my friendship bracelet with.

00:02:54.967 --> 00:02:57.427
-Best friends forever!
-Hey, let go!

00:02:57.511 --> 00:03:00.430
-Paws to yourself.
-Hold still.

00:03:00.514 --> 00:03:02.975
Forever's a long time, kid.
I have a song to deliver.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.520
Nice meeting you. Peace.

00:03:13.068 --> 00:03:15.070
Are those
little gravestones?

00:03:15.153 --> 00:03:16.655
Oh, that's my petting zoo.

00:03:17.489 --> 00:03:18.824
Well, it was.

00:03:19.825 --> 00:03:21.952
-Gabi.
-It's my mum. Hide!

00:03:23.078 --> 00:03:24.288
Hernández!

00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:27.875
Oh, hello, blonde one.

00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:29.168
Other girls.

00:03:29.251 --> 00:03:30.627
Gabi, where's your uniform?

00:03:30.711 --> 00:03:32.963
Yes, we have rules,
Hernández.

00:03:33.755 --> 00:03:36.216
Only a Sand Dollar
in full uniform

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.010
may participate
in a cookie sale.

00:03:38.093 --> 00:03:41.013
What?
The cookie sale's today?

00:03:41.096 --> 00:03:43.182
I totally thought
that was yesterday.

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:45.392
But you didn't show up
yesterday either, did you?

00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:46.894
That's a good point.

00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:50.272
I was busy
rescuing this animal.

00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:53.358
What are you doing?

00:03:53.442 --> 00:03:55.110
Oh, he's so cute!

00:03:55.194 --> 00:03:56.153
Can I pet him?

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.405
-No.
-Go to town. He loves it.

00:03:58.488 --> 00:03:59.698
Look at that face.

00:03:59.781 --> 00:04:01.241
-He's adorable.
-Hey. Stop.

00:04:01.325 --> 00:04:02.784
This is borderline abuse.

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:04.995
-His little ears.
-So fuzzy. What's his name?

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:05.996
His name's Vivo.

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.623
We have totally
different definitions

00:04:07.706 --> 00:04:08.624
of the word "plan".

00:04:08.707 --> 00:04:10.292
To me,
and other rational people,

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:12.127
a plan revolves
around the five Ps.

00:04:12.211 --> 00:04:14.046
"Proper planning
prevents poor performance."

00:04:14.129 --> 00:04:15.422
But you,

00:04:15.506 --> 00:04:19.301
your plans
are just bad impulses.

00:04:20.135 --> 00:04:21.178
What are you doing?

00:04:21.803 --> 00:04:22.679
Ta-da!

00:04:22.763 --> 00:04:24.765
Sometimes
you gotta improvise.

00:04:26.767 --> 00:04:27.935
Yeah, that will never float.

00:04:32.064 --> 00:04:35.108
And the journey begins now!

00:04:36.777 --> 00:04:37.694
It floats.

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:39.404
It actually floats.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:40.864
Heads up!

00:04:43.075 --> 00:04:45.577
Give me a sec.
Don't wanna pull a hammy.

00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:48.080
OK. Ready, Vivo?

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:54.086
And she missed.

00:04:59.842 --> 00:05:01.969
I missed the boat
completely.

00:05:03.512 --> 00:05:05.222
Did you see that, Vivo?

00:05:05.806 --> 00:05:07.391
Hysterical.

